; Test inventory: classification checked by check_test_inventory under
; dune runtest. Every test and executable stanza in test/dune and
; test/mocks/dune must appear here.
;   deterministic  must run under dune runtest
;   env-gated      runs elsewhere; (gate ...) names where
;   manual         diagnostic program; (reason ...) says why it is not a test
;   tool           executable used by rules, not a test; (reason ...) required
;   obsolete       stanza removed; its source may stay; (reason ...) required
; Deterministic suites: unconditional (test) stanzas run by dune runtest.

